{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 18,
  "name": {
    "ja": "湖の洞窟",
    "en": "Water Cave",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "FIND_EXIT",
    "level": 35,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "最近湖の近くに洞窟の入口が現れました。どうか中を調べて何があるか見て",
          "きて下さい。ただし、洞窟の入口はあまり安定してないようなので",
          "気をつけて下さい！",
        ],
        "en": [
          "A tunnel opening has recently been exposed on",
          "the shore of our lake. Please investigate and",
          "discover what is inside. Be careful! The",
          "tunnel entrance does not appear to be very",
          "stable.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "人々が洞窟に間違って入らないようにトンネルを閉鎖しておきました。",
          "どうぞ外にある我々からの贈物を受けとって下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "We have closed the tunnel to prevent anybody from",
          "getting trapped in the cavern. Please accept the",
          "gift that awaits you outside as an reward for your",
          "help.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["この仕事はあなたには難しかったようですね。"],
        "en": ["It seems like this task was too difficult for you."],
      },
    },
  ],
